      "@type": "ToxicityAssessment",
      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Hateful",
      "description": "The meme directly attacks Black people by using a dehumanizing visual metaphor (human skeleton) to imply they are inherently primitive or animal-like, reinforcing the harmful stereotype that they are biologically predisposed to criminal behavior. This is a direct racialized dehumanization that targets a specific racial group with derogatory and dangerous stereotypes, which is a form of hateful content.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
